ThreeFCapability
├── configuration
│   ├── requires an adapter self-call
│   └── keeps minimum yield and funding budgets per collateral underlying
├── mintRequest
│   ├── validates request whitelist, vault asset and facility intent
│   ├── validates the adapter's live push authorization and caller bounds
│   ├── enforces duration budget and minimum yield
│   ├── spends directly from the adapter using a separate token approval
│   ├── keeps PT and YT on the adapter and records the exact principal
│   └── rejects callbacks, unexpected spending and duplicate or excessive requests
├── finalizeRequest
│   ├── requires an adapter self-call and tracked request
│   ├── receives funds directly on the adapter and removes position tracking
│   └── preserves period spending and works with disabled funding budgets
└── replacement and isolation
    ├── retains requests, yield floors and funding usage across replacement
    ├── keeps adapters sharing one implementation independent
    └── values positions without counting the adapter's idle funds
